$$
E = \frac{(m_1 + m_2) \cdot v^2}{2} = \frac{(1.28 + 0.32) \cdot (41.8)^2}{2} = \frac{1.6 \cdot 1747.24}{2} = \frac{2795.584}{2} = 1397.792 \, \text{J}
$$

